out←executePrepared stmt;result;_error_message;column_names;count;chunks;st
⍝ Execute a prepared statement and return results
⍝ stmt: prepared statement pointer
⍝ Returns: same format as query function
⎕io←0
:If stmt=0
    out←'Invalid prepared statement!' ⋄ →0
:EndIf

(st result)←api.duckdb_execute_prepared stmt 6
out←getResults (st result)
